    "en": {
      "name": "Kabira Bay",
      "description": "Awarded 3 stars by Michelin Green Guide Japan, Kabira Bay features breathtaking multi-hued turquoise waters, black pearl cultivation reefs, and white sand shores.",
      "highlights": [
        "Take a glass-bottom boat tour to view giant clams, sea turtles, and corals",
        "Walk up to Kabira Park viewpoint for sweeping bay panoramas",
        "Observe black pearl culture displays at local shore boutiques"
      ],
      "reservationInfo": "Glass-bottom boat tickets available on arrival at beach huts.",
      "parkingInfo": "Municipal paid parking lot near Kabira Park entrance (¥300).",
      "openingHours": "Bay view open 24/7; glass-bottom boats 09:00 - 17:00."
    },
    "ja": {
      "name": "川平湾",
      "description": "ミシュラン・グリーンガイド・ジャポンで最高ランク三ツ星を獲得した石垣島一の景勝地。時間や潮の満ち引きで七色に変化する海と黒真珠の養殖で有名。",
      "highlights": [
        "グラスボートで覗く熱帯魚や巨大シャコガイ、サンゴ礁の海中世界",
        "川平公園の展望台から望む小島が浮かぶ絵画のような絶景"
      ],
      "reservationInfo": "グラスボート乗船券は現地各社で随時購入可能（予約なしでも乗船可）。",
      "parkingInfo": "川平公園有料駐車場あり（300円）。",
      "openingHours": "景観見学は自由。グラスボート運航09:00〜17:00。"
